  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shiraka Training Programme Local Governance 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this annual course is for civil servants working in the field of local governance to share their knowledge and skills, enabling them to lead and inspire the modernisation of local governance. The course also aims to strengthen participants&apos; ties with the Netherlands and the Dutch government, especially between Dutch civil servants and their counterparts in the target countries.</narrative>
  </description>
